# Per-cell SFINCS output (large; regeneratable by run_baseline.sh /
# run_verify.sh against a re-built GPU binary at the pre-fix HEAD and
# post-fix HEAD respectively). Unanchored so the pattern catches the
# nested prefix/<cell>/ and postfix/<cell>/ run subdirs.
sfincs_map.nc
sfincs_his.nc
__pycache__

# Per-cell symlinks back to tests/cases/<case>/ source inputs.
# stage_case() symlinks the forcing / grid files so the SFINCS binary
# can read them without copying; the symlinks must not enter git (they
# would resolve outside the tree or duplicate the source case bytes).
# sfincs.inp is a real copy (length-modified) and is NOT excluded.
# Unanchored basenames so both prefix/<cell>/ and postfix/<cell>/ are
# covered.
sfincs.dep
sfincs.msk
sfincs.bnd
sfincs.bzs
sfincs.amu
sfincs.amv
sfincs.prcp
sfincs.psi
sfincs.sigma
sfincs.ks
sfincs.scs
sfincs.src
sfincs.dis
sfincs.weir
sfincs.nc
sfincs_subgrid.nc
snapwave.*
